OL,3,GNEWSA'Lego-type blocks' anger woman who
OL,4,Awas fenced in
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has placed two "concrete
OL,7,FLego-type" blocks at the rear access to
OL,8,Fthe home of an 81-year-old just one
OL,9,Fweek after she won a legal wrangle over
OL,10,Faccess.
OL,12,FRetired teacher Helene Ball won a
OL,13,Fthree-year battle against Derbyshire
OL,14,FCounty Council after it fenced off a
OL,15,F98cm gated gap between her garden and a
OL,16,Fcouncil car park in April 2023.
OL,18,FAs well as being fenced in, dozens of
OL,19,Fconcrete blocks were laid on the access
OL,20,Froad leading to the car park, off
OL,21,FCavendish Road in Matlock, after it was
OL,22,Fput on the market.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
