OL,3,GNEWSA'Lego-type blocks' anger woman who
OL,4,Awas fenced in
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter a first-tier tribunal ruled in
OL,7,FBall's favour on 27 August, she said
OL,8,Fthe council was "a law unto themselves"
OL,9,Fafter two new concrete blocks were laid
OL,10,Fat the rear of her home.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
